251
00:15:56,380 --> 00:15:58,792
Well, I see you did your homework, Kaiba.

252
00:15:59,040 --> 00:16:00,922
Now I place this card face down.

253
00:16:03,060 --> 00:16:04,520
What a duel!

254
00:16:04,900 --> 00:16:06,312
This could take all day.

255
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:09,237
Neither Egyptian god
card can be destroyed.

256
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:11,720
All right, this is a whale of a duel.

257
00:16:23,380 --> 00:16:25,960
This is the duel I've been waiting for.

258
00:16:26,300 --> 00:16:29,124
It's the ultimate battle
of intellect and power.

259
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:31,340
Every time I duel against Yugi,

260
00:16:31,620 --> 00:16:35,320
I'm pushed to my limits and
challenged in every possible way.

261
00:16:41,060 --> 00:16:43,900
Even though I defeated
him in Duelist Kingdom,

262
00:16:44,220 --> 00:16:46,597
he's known as the
world's greatest duelist.

263
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:47,980
Oh, no!

264
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:55,340
But that title belongs to me, and
when I win the Battle City Tournament,

265
00:16:55,540 --> 00:16:56,680
I'll have it back.

266
00:16:57,840 --> 00:17:01,037
It's only a matter of time
before Yugi's reputation

267
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:04,960
comes crumbling down at the
hands of my Egyptian god card.

268
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:08,080
All right, Yugi, my move!

269
00:17:10,540 --> 00:17:11,540
You ready?

270
00:17:12,320 --> 00:17:15,537
Now then, you only have
one card in your hand.

271
00:17:15,620 --> 00:17:18,620
That means Slifer's
attack points are 1,000.

272
00:17:18,900 --> 00:17:20,740
So let's see you escape now.

273
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:25,340
It's time to show the world
that I'm superior to you!

274
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:28,100
Go, Obelisk!

275
00:17:28,460 --> 00:17:31,320
Annihilate his Slifer
with your Fist of Fate!

276
00:17:32,620 --> 00:17:33,450
Guess again!

277
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:36,440
Reveal the Magic Card!

278
00:17:36,620 --> 00:17:37,920
Spell Textbook!

279
00:17:38,520 --> 00:17:44,297
Now I must discard every card in my hand,
and in exchange, I can draw one new card.

280
00:17:44,380 --> 00:17:48,940
I can then play the card immediately,
but only if I draw a magic card.

281
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:57,206
Now that Slifer's attack points
are zero, you'll lose the duel.

282
00:17:58,340 --> 00:18:00,460
Avalis, wipe out his life points!

283
00:18:02,140 --> 00:18:03,100
This is it!

284
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:05,339
If I don't draw the right card now,

285
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:08,477
I'll lose to Kaiba and be
eliminated from the tournament!

286
00:18:08,560 --> 00:18:09,390
Come on, Joey!

287
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:10,600
Guide me!

288
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:13,260
I need your help to save the world!

289
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:20,700
I activate this magic card. What's that?

290
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:22,100
Card of Sanctity.

291
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:27,400
It requires both of us to draw until
each one of us is holding six cards.

292
00:18:33,860 --> 00:18:34,840
Oh, no.

293
00:18:35,140 --> 00:18:38,375
That means his Egyptian god
card increases in strength.

294
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:40,080
That's right.

295
00:18:40,320 --> 00:18:43,040
And now Slifer has 6,000 attack points.

296
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:47,860
You're about to lose this duel, Kaiba!

297
00:18:49,340 --> 00:18:50,660
Hold on!

298
00:18:50,940 --> 00:18:53,240
I activate my final trap card!

299
00:18:53,500 --> 00:18:54,780
Life Shaver!

300
00:18:55,420 --> 00:18:59,780
It shaves 2,000 attack points
off your Egyptian God card!

301
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:15,160
What's going on?

302
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:18,604
Kyber Corp holograms
aren't supposed to do this!

303
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:24,040
Look out!

304
00:19:26,180 --> 00:19:29,592
I don't know what the deal is,
but this doesn't look good!

305
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:31,470
Yugi!

306
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:34,460
What could be going on, you guys?

307
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:37,240
I can't see a thing out there!

308
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:41,320
The true power of Ancient Egypt
is beginning to reveal itself!

309
00:19:41,700 --> 00:19:43,780
And I fear for us all!

310
00:19:59,780 --> 00:20:00,700
Let's go.
